# MATLAB P-code and MAT-files are binary. Git's content heuristic already
# detects them, but marking them explicitly keeps a clone with
# core.autocrlf=true (Windows default) from line-ending-normalising and
# corrupting them. Vendored under the matlab-* skills; see
# .skill-vault/README.md -> "Vendored bundles".
*.p   binary
*.mat binary

.github/workflows/*.lock.yml linguist-generated=true